Package: crew.ssh
Type: Package
Title: 'crew' Launcher Plugin for SSH Workers on a Local Network
Description: An experimental 'crew' (<https://wlandau.github.io/crew/>) launcher
    plugin that runs workers on remote machines over SSH, for distributing
    'targets' pipelines across several computers on a trusted local network.
    Workers are placed across nodes using per-node capacity weights, so
    heterogeneous machines (differing in RAM or CPU) can share a single
    controller. This is a lightweight counterpart to 'crew.cluster' (which
    targets traditional high-performance-computing schedulers) for ad-hoc SSH
    clusters. The package is experimental and currently private / unpublished.
Version: 0.0.4
